> mod5brid <- occu(~ f1 + f2 ~ 1, ocbrid)
> summary(mod5brid)

Call:
occu(formula = ~f1 + f2 ~ 1, data = ocbrid)

Occupancy (logit-scale):
 Estimate    SE    z P(>|z|)
